*[[Australia–Fiji relations]]
**[[Australia]] agrees to provide [[Fiji]] with solar, wind and [[wave-powered]] [[Bluebottle (uncrewed surface vessels)|Bluebottle]] [[maritime drone]]s and training for [[surveillance]] and efforts against [[drug trafficking]] and other [[transnational crime]], with deployment expected in 2027. [https://www.rfi.fr/en/international-news/20261016-fiji-to-deploy-solar-powered-australian-military-drones-at-sea (AFP via RFI)]
