**[[Prime Minister of Hungary|Hungarian prime minister]] [[Péter Magyar]] and [[President of Ukraine|Ukrainian president]] [[Volodymyr Zelenskyy]] agree to improve bilateral relations during a meeting in [[Brussels]], [[Belgium]], with [[Hungary]] lifting objections to further [[Accession of Ukraine to the European Union|Ukrainian European Union accession]] talks following progress on [[Hungarians in Ukraine|ethnic Hungarian]] [[minority rights]] in [[Ukraine]]. [https://www.reuters.com/world/hungary-ukraine-agree-reset-ties-magyar-says-2026-10-16/ (Reuters)]

